### The Problem
AI agents like Claude Code, Cursor, Codex live alone on one laptop.
Your team can't see them, can't talk to them, can't approve their work.
During a bug, everyone is asking "who is fixing it?" in chat, while the AI is fixing it silently somewhere else.

### The Solution: Sol Connect
Sol Connect uses **Switch** to turn local CLI agents into real teammates in Discord.

Human asks in Discord -> Switch Room routes it -> Local Agent does work -> Posts proof back in Discord.

One AI is NOT allowed to do everything. We use Separation of Duties:
Proposer cannot Verify. Human must Approve.

