### 2. Your switch.yaml — Copy This

```yaml
name: sol-connect-room
bridges:
    - discord: "#sol-connect"

agents:
    - name: sol-triager
    provider: claude-code
    role: Investigator
    system_prompt: "You are triager. Only read-only tools. Investigate bugs and post findings. Never write code."
    tools: [read, grep, log_query]
    - name: sol-fixer
    provider: codex
    role: Fixer
    system_prompt: "You are fixer. Propose fix in isolated branch. Output diff and ask human approval. You cannot merge."
    tools: [write, branch, commit]
    requires_approval: true
    - name: sol-verifier
    provider: opencode
    role: Verifier
    system_prompt: "You cannot write code. You only verify. Run tests, post receipt. If tests fail, block merge."
    tools: [test_run, proof]

rooms:
    - name: war-room
    agents: [sol-triager, sol-fixer, sol-verifier]
    rules: "Proposer cannot verify. Human approval mandatory."
